DD-L025 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L025)

  × `set_led` retries a command that writes to the device
    ╭─[52-L025-retry-non-idempotent.yaml:41:5]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │     retries: 3
    ·     ───┬───
    ·        ╰── unsafe retry
 42 │ safety:
    ╰────
  help: if running it twice is harmless, add `idempotent: true` to the command (next to
        `retries`); otherwise remove `retries` (spec §9.1)
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[52-L025-retry-non-idempotent.yaml:42:1]
 41 │     retries: 3
 42 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 43 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
